    "resolved_source_issues": [
      {
        "claim": "The printed p. 142 proof-stage footnote 2 bis uses sous-truc where the categorical term is sous-objet; sem/r14 also coalesces this independently targetable footnote with theorem node tohoku:thm:2.2.2:p2.",
        "control": "Preserve sous-truc in diplomatic French, use sous-objet in corrected French, and preserve English. Keep the footnote as separate stable node tohoku:footnote:2bis. Its sufficient condition remains under enough injectives and must be read together with the theorem's separate half-exactness requirement; do not infer arbitrary-F exactness, derived-functor identification, negative satellites, or an all-degree statement. D000995 closes only this categorical-term and semantic-coalescing issue.",
        "evidence": "Official Part I SHA-256 5A8E5720BC2EF8905BF85F7919C65AC4A87A31CFC854BD77E6B5084C0D2DEBEF, printed p. 142, proof-stage footnote 2 bis. production/p142_fix1/check.json, 7250 bytes, SHA-256 61DC1736262199D5909580C85756ADFA90C59C7D3BF12ADE4848995DA13A2A25, seals the sole corrected-French categorical substitution sous-truc to sous-objet while retaining byte-exact diplomatic French and English. build/v068c3r13/build.json, 97649 bytes, SHA-256 982525DD08B21E8F2C4A04E6F3D1B7FF99F5547E79F95F28496DC6B2CB0FE2EE, and qa/v68r34/check.json, 13181 bytes, SHA-256 188C5E4A6930CBC1597D8582C7E935AAD6160FF0344ABF3401ABC7E7C1A04BD0, seal the reader successor and independent visual audit. sem/r15/manifest.json, 10320 bytes, SHA-256 8C35707629E40C70049B17A02ECD71891264D057A8E32712B3565FFDFEFE3540, sem/r15/validation.json, 4129 bytes, SHA-256 0C15FDE42EF5C32401F2F045450024DACC669920274D996D85F74E110ADC75CF, and qa/v68r35/sem-check.json, 6726 bytes, SHA-256 F268C2D8553988384C650B011DB3594467F59588E05412C7A56F2FC9C5C924A9, split former combined occurrence tohoku:occ:p142:o001 into theorem occurrence tohoku:occ:p142:o001 and footnote occurrence tohoku:occ:p142:o005. The latter has diplomatic, corrected-French, and English segment hashes EA8B36BA929EFCA6C8F9ED07DD44DD423DAFF759FD61FAECEEAACC523420458A, 5B11411F10E0890642AE975252504B71EAC28B3F340BD5DC7D1693E58897CC60, and 189974B1A267AE730AE7DEF32084812D2717FD7FB596508E9F4B354617FDF1CA.",
